<< /AP << /N 1082 0 R >> /C [ 1.0 0.819611 0.0 ] /CA 0.399994 /Contents (This is not true for the early East Slavic texts since the yers have been preserved longer here \(12th-13th c.\).) /CreationDate (D:20260826173009+02'00') /F 4 /M (D:20260914175629+02'00') /NM (3f2d151e-e563-4331-9506-d31a172df35c) /P 35 0 R /Popup 1083 0 R /QuadPoints [ 246.267 730.573 249.267 730.573 246.267 715.153 249.267 715.153 ] /RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:26.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.2pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">This is not true for the early East Slavic texts since the yers have been preserved longer here \(12th-13th c.\).</span></p></body>) /Rect [ 245.785 714.671 249.748 731.055 ] /Subj (Hervorheben) /Subtype /Highlight /T (Anonymous) /Type /Annot >>
