<< /AP << /N 1088 0 R >> /C [ 1.0 0.819611 0.0 ] /CA 0.399994 /Contents (This is a doubtful designation. The Slavic languages developed from the Common Slavic dialect continuum \(especially Holzer 1997\). I suggest to write "pre-Czech" vel sim.\r\rHolzer, Georg. 1997. Zum gemeinslavischen Dialektkontinuum. Wiener slavistisches Jahrbuch\r43.87\205102.) /CreationDate (D:20260826184126+02'00') /F 4 /M (D:20260914175638+02'00') /NM (35458e23-dc65-4fb0-b87d-44a10d7781cb) /P 35 0 R /Popup 1089 0 R /QuadPoints [ 396.206 633.973 455.509 633.973 396.206 618.553 455.509 618.553 ] /RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:26.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.6pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">This is a doubtful designation. The Slavic languages developed from the Common Slavic dialect continuum \(especially Holzer 1997\). I suggest to write &quot;pre-Czech&quot; vel sim.&#13;&#13;</span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-12.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">Holzer, Georg. 1997. Zum gemeinslavischen Dialektkontinuum. </span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-12.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic">Wiener slavistisches Jahrbuch&#13;</span><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-12.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">43.87&#8211;102.</span></p></body>) /Rect [ 395.724 618.071 455.991 634.455 ] /Subj (Hervorheben) /Subtype /Highlight /T (Anonymous) /Type /Annot >>
endobj
