<< /AP << /N 1106 0 R >> /C [ 1.0 0.819611 0.0 ] /CA 0.399994 /Contents <> /CreationDate (D:20260826222019+02'00') /F 4 /M (D:20260914175747+02'00') /NM (d0d4cb30-31cb-42e6-9b5b-68068d12f1d2) /P 35 0 R /Popup 1107 0 R /QuadPoints [ 503.53 138.159 508.09 138.159 503.53 125.309 508.09 125.309 ] /RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:26.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.2pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">Incorrect yer. If this would be *&#1100; we would expect the reflex of the First Regressive Palatalizaiton.</span></p></body>) /Rect [ 503.128 124.908 508.491 138.561 ] /Subj (Hervorheben) /Subtype /Highlight /T (Anonymous) /Type /Annot >>
