<< /AP << /N 1115 0 R >> /C [ 1.0 0.819611 0.0 ] /CA 0.399994 /Contents (Translation needed. It also should be explained what the authors \(or rather Zaliznjak\) mean by "bytovoj". I cannot be expected that all readers  of Transactions know that.) /CreationDate (D:20260826222412+02'00') /F 4 /M (D:20260914175803+02'00') /NM (00b2e388-57e9-42ac-82c1-28a56d5efef8) /P 35 0 R /Popup 1116 0 R /QuadPoints [ 239.699 80.259 355.638 80.259 239.699 67.4091 355.638 67.4091 ] /RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:26.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.6pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">Translation needed. It also should be explained what the authors \(or rather Zaliznjak\) mean by &quot;bytovoj&quot;. I cannot be expected that all readers  of Transactions know that.</span></p></body>) /Rect [ 239.297 67.0075 356.04 80.6605 ] /Subj (Hervorheben) /Subtype /Highlight /T (Anonymous) /Type /Annot >>
