<< /AP << /N 1131 0 R >> /C [ 1.0 0.819611 0.0 ] /CA 0.399994 /Contents (The authors should at least provide some references to handbooks on Slavic historical phonology.) /CreationDate (D:20260826224645+02'00') /F 4 /M (D:20260914175819+02'00') /NM (bfda1475-3ee2-421e-9696-33e9ef9705be) /P 36 0 R /Popup 1132 0 R /QuadPoints [ 169.311 771.973 172.311 771.973 169.311 756.553 172.311 756.553 ] /RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:26.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:10.2pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">The authors should at least provide some references to handbooks on Slavic historical phonology.</span></p></body>) /Rect [ 168.829 756.071 172.793 772.455 ] /Subj (Hervorheben) /Subtype /Highlight /T (Anonymous) /Type /Annot >>
