<< /AP << /N 1178 0 R >> /C [ 1.0 0.819611 0.0 ] /CA 0.399994 /Contents (Do the authors mean that foreign sounds were substituted in the language of the scribe? In this case it would not be the letters that are replaced. The letters would only reflect the substitution of sounds.) /CreationDate (D:20260826233258+02'00') /F 4 /M (D:20260914175958+02'00') /NM (431e4912-0963-4940-86a2-4b59cb998e76) /P 37 0 R /Popup 1179 0 R /QuadPoints [ 338.58 771.973 345.336 771.973 338.58 756.553 345.336 756.553 345.55 771.901 352.558 771.901 345.55 755.089 352.558 755.089 352.55 771.973 355.55 771.973 352.55 756.553 355.55 756.553 355.55 771.901 362.87 771.901 355.55 755.089 362.87 755.089 359.2 771.973 388.696 771.973 359.2 756.553 388.696 756.553 388.7 771.973 412.156 771.973 388.7 755.089 412.156 755.089 ] /RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:26.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.6pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">Do the authors mean that foreign sounds were substituted in the language of the scribe? In this case it would not be the letters that are replaced. The letters would only reflect the substitution of sounds.</span></p></body>) /Rect [ 338.098 754.562 412.684 772.501 ] /Subj (Hervorheben) /Subtype /Highlight /T (Anonymous) /Type /Annot >>
endobj
