<< /AP << /N 1267 0 R >> /C [ 0.588242 0.262741 0.988235 ] /CA 0.399994 /Contents <> /CreationDate (D:20260906174806+02'00') /F 4 /IT /HighlightNote /M (D:20260914180315+02'00') /NM (509f039b-6102-4693-86cf-17b8fd994785) /P 39 0 R /Popup 1268 0 R /QuadPoints [ 73.8 230.409 93.21 230.409 73.8 217.559 93.21 217.559 ] /RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:26.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">The OCS examples are not a good choice here because of the merger of  original *ir \(&gt; *&#1100;r\) and *ri \(&gt; *r&#1100;\) between consonants \(adopting the view that PIE liquids were resolved in Slavic\).</span></p></body>) /Rect [ 73.3984 217.158 93.6116 230.811 ] /Subj (Kommentar zu Text) /Subtype /Highlight /T (Anonymous) /Type /Annot >>
