<< /AP << /N 1398 0 R >> /C [ 0.588242 0.262741 0.988235 ] /CA 0.399994 /Contents ("I have") /CreationDate (D:20260906225422+02'00') /F 4 /IT /HighlightNote /M (D:20260914180743+02'00') /NM (2c4d941d-0bbf-42a7-b6b7-d5fdb02d8280) /P 48 0 R /Popup 1399 0 R /QuadPoints [ 277.739 103.359 292.269 103.359 277.739 90.5091 292.269 90.5091 ] /RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:26.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2" ><p dir="ltr"><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal">&quot;I have&quot;</span></p></body>) /Rect [ 277.337 90.1075 292.67 103.761 ] /Subj (Kommentar zu Text) /Subtype /Highlight /T (Anonymous) /Type /Annot >>
